start_url	index.html
icons	Multiple sizes in icons/ directory

Service Worker (sw.js)
The Service Worker intercepts network requests and serves cached responses when the device is offline. The offline pill at the top of the page (📴 You're offline) is displayed when the browser detects no network connectivity. This allows users to view their previously logged data even without an internet connection.
Install Prompt
FitLog listens for the beforeinstallprompt browser event. When detected, an Add to Home Screen button is revealed in Settings. Tapping it triggers the browser's native install prompt. On iOS Safari, users are guided to use the browser's Share > Add to Home Screen flow since iOS does not support the programmatic install prompt API.

