15. Keyboard & Accessibility
FitLog is primarily designed for touch/mouse interaction. The following accessibility provisions are present:
•	All interactive buttons use native <button> elements, inheriting keyboard focusability.
•	Modal close buttons are accessible via Tab + Enter/Space.
•	The app title, description, and application-name meta tags are set for assistive technologies.
•	SVG icons embedded in the nav use aria-hidden where they are decorative.
•	The theme colour meta tag (#00E5BB) hints the browser chrome on mobile.
Full ARIA landmark roles, skip navigation, and screen-reader-optimised flows are noted as potential future improvements (see Section 19).

